# As aid-casting-bonus-aid.keys, for a character that is already in wizard
# mode (the frozen druid is: `w` opens the menu with no confirmation prompt).
# tools/check_aid_casting_bonus.sh (bd inc-9uuj).
w
@choose "Become Divine Champion"
"Aid Casting Bonus Test God" ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC

m PGDN*20
@expect "Chance:"
@dump:spell
ESC
@quit
